# .claude/ is intentionally NOT ignored wholesale: rules/, commands/ and
# skills/ are project guidance referenced by CLAUDE.md, and a blanket rule made
# new rule files vanish silently (they never showed up in `git status`).
# Ignore only per-machine state and anything holding credentials.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/**/.DS_Store
# Contains hardcoded R2 credentials on the maintainer's machine. The shared
# copy inside upload-to-r2.zip reads them from the environment instead; keep
# this local variant out of the repository regardless of other rules.
.claude/skills/upload-to-r2/scripts/upload-to-r2.js
.claude/skills/upload-to-r2/upload-to-r2/

